  "ALL_TEXT": "128 INT. MINISTER'S HOUSE-STAGE - NIGHT \nThe stage is set for a burrakatha. We have the two narrators \nin the foreground, and on stage - a prop Kailasha mountain, \nSUBBA RAJU as Raavan, VEDA as SHIVA, SULOCHANA as Parvathi, \nGOVARDHAN as Nandi, the BUM as KARTHIKEYA, and the \nILLEGITIMATE SON as KUBERA \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 1 \n(in a sing song way) \nRavanudu step brother aina Kuberudu \nni mount Alaka pai dacoity chesi \nKuberudi Pushpak airlines ni take \nover chesi \nRaavan has Kubera at gunpoint on the mountain. Shiva and \nParvathi are doing the tandavam. \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 2 \n(in a sing song way) \nNO fly zone ayina mount Kailash \nvaipu vochadu. \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 1 \n(in a sing song way) \nShivudu technologically advanced \nundadam valla flight ground \naypoindhi \nDuring his dance, Shiva puts his foot on the mountain with \nvigor. Meanwhile, CHINTHAN BABA is made it to the stage, and \nwatches from behind the curtain. \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 2 \n(in a sing song way) \nShameless ga trespass chesina \nravanudu ni chusina akakde unna \nwatchman-cum-driver nandi nasty gaa \nmatladutunnam to \nNandi stares indifferently at Raavan \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 1 \n(in a sing song way) \nRaavanudu kopam gaa mountain ni \nshake chesaadu \nRaavan pushes off Kubera and the prop mountain from on top of \nhim \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 2 \n(in a sing song way) \nMountain paina romantic gaa salsa \nchestunna Shiv-Parvati shake \navaddam valla Parvathi Shivudni \ngattiga pattukundi \nVEDA and SULOCHANA, as Shiva and Parvathi, are on their own \nwhirlwind romance, dancing on top of the mountain. The \nILLEGITIMATE SON does not take kindly to the brewing romance \nbetween SULOCHANA and VEDA \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 1 \n(in a sing song way) \nShivudiki \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 2 \n(in a sing song way) \nShivudikiudiki oka banda raaya \nisiraadu \nSUBBA RAJU then looks at Karthikeya. The BUM scratches his \nhead, not responding to any of the stage direction. Raavan is \nnow angry. He throws his slipper and hits Karthikeya. \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 1 \n(in a sing song way) \nSigguleni Raavanudu malli big \nintestines ni tesi guitar vayinchi \nbell kottadu \nRaavan now grabs a hold of the sitar, and strums along. The \nBUM does not take kindly to the throw, and gets off the \nstage. He pulls out his red briefcase, seeing which CHINTHAN \nBABA confronts the BUM. The two have a tug of war over the \nbriefcase, which spills over to the stage. The FOREST \nMINISTER is a little taken aback by this. \nFOREST MINISTER \nIdhe kadha ra baba chepina erra \nbrief case \nLEAD GOON \nUko anna adhe pacha briefcase \nHe rubs his eyes and focuses hard. \nASSISTANT GOON \nAnna ki varnandhathvam undhi sir, \neppudinincho chepdham ante edhigo \nedu aputhunadu \nFOREST MINISTER \nAnte \nSUB-ASSISTANT GOON \nAdhe anna colour blindness \nIt is his red briefcase. He gets up and orders his people \nFOREST MINISTER \nvedhavalara...pattukondi vaadini... \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 1 \n(in a sing song way) \nMusic pichi unna shivudu ventane \noka idol ni visiraadu \nBURRAKATHA NARRATOR 2 \n(in a sing song way) \nKaani Ganesh sahaayam tho...sorry \nsorry Ganesh ki loosulu undatam \nvalla Karthikeyudu sahaayam to idol \nni chombu loki padesaaru \nThe briefcase breaks apart. A wooden box lay in it. The BUM \nand CHINTHAN BABA now tussle over the box too. Everyone else \non stage has stopped what they're doing, looking on \ncuriously, stationary. \nThe FOREST MINISTER runs to the stage as fast as possible. \nAll of this is punctured by the box breaking open. The idol \ninside the box pops up, and falls into the chombu as Shiva is \npushed back by Raavan. \nCUT TO: ",
